{"id":961214,"imdb":"tt29452783","en":"Reawakened Man","orig":"부활남: 더 레드","ar":null,"tag":"I'll be back, alive.","ov":"Despite unwavering support from his best friend Young-ha and the unwavering support of his younger sister Ye-rin, job seeker Seok Hwan just can't seem to land a job, repeatedly failing interviews. One night, after yet another disastrous interview, he returns home only to be attacked by a group of strangers and killed. But 72 hours after his death, Seok Hwan suddenly opens his eyes as if nothing happened. He soon discovers that he possesses a special ability: no matter how many times he dies, he comes back to life. But there's little time to process his extraordinary new power before a mysterious figure known as Black, who has discovered Hwan's existence, begins hunting him down.  Yet with each resurrection, Seok Hwan grows stronger, unleashing powers beyond anything he could have imagined!","rd":"2026-09-30","rt":102,"g":[28,14,35],"lang":"ko","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Yong Film","logo":"/dj9VQ8Tqw4OTP8h5JkSOQGpEeMR.png","c":"KR"},{"n":"Superfiction","logo":"/H29PpgUFrr5XgoqBFJLd7OCp02.png","c":"KR"},{"n":"YLAB","logo":"/drUn9QIaCOsI2LMOwDjprdybHKB.png","c":"KR"},{"n":"STUDIO NU:NGIL","logo":null,"c":"KR"}],"countries":["KR"],"langs":["Korean","English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"KR","d":"2026-09-30"},{"c":"SG","d":"2026-10-01"},{"c":"TW","d":"2026-10-01"},{"c":"ID","d":"2026-10-07"},{"c":"FR","d":"2026-10-31"}],"dir":["Baek Jong-yeol"],"prod":["Syd Lim"],"wri":["Kang Sun-ju","Park Jung-sin"],"mus":["Primary"],"dop":["Jeoun Sung-ho"],"cast":[{"n":"Koo Kyo-hwan","ch":"Seok Hwan / Red","p":"/aFwCpSKPGFqoiTStY6ljXnD5CwH.jpg"},{"n":"Shin Seung-ho","ch":"Black","p":"/6Ca6UNuwVmHPIVGIPQuChOp7oJp.jpg"},{"n":"Kang Ki-young","ch":"Young-ha","p":"/xjsYs1nOzw2zbyJtRwHzWRblFrA.jpg"},{"n":"Kim Sia","ch":"Cha Ye-rin","p":"/4xNracGIzNRRLNbIO5cWigbPpCA.jpg"},{"n":"Kim Sung-ryung","ch":"Mi-joo","p":"/sPB8ySlzfJWNedISwugRWEBABIY.jpg"},{"n":"Kim In-woo",